{"ts": "2026-08-17T13:55:18Z", "agent": "claude", "seq": 14, "kind": "tool_result", "text": " M docs/design.md\n M docs/spec.md\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.css\n M frontend/src/App.jsx\n M frontend/src/components/AddTask.jsx\n M frontend/src/components/TaskList.jsx\n?? docs/implementation.md\n---BRANCH---\nfeature/tp-14/make-app-usable-from-keyboard\n---LOG---\n2b6cbd5 Merge round 8: Give tasks a due date\n3c8a6a5 Give tasks a due date (Taiga #12)\n5e852f6 Merge round 7: Search tasks by title\n7c1276f Search tasks by title (Taiga #11)\n255db69 Merge round 6: Show me how many tasks are left", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01UESDnwDNLgcZaJYTYHyRYf", "session_id": "81525146-4aee-4ecb-9258-95581c0d5dc8"}}
